      "writtenOn": "2025-07-21T20:31:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m wondering if this flag is strictly necessary. Would there be a time where we specified `-fbounds-safety`, but didn\u0027t want the annotations to have an effect?",
      "revId": "6018b88715edc11413ce56e0902bb32c5bdd1e27",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
